course: dictionary
lesson: 16150
title: Windless and still air
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Windless is a word for air that is not moving. Wind means moving air, so windless means there is no wind at all. «The windless day was perfect for a picnic.» On a windy day the sandwiches might blow away, so a windless day must be one with no wind.
explain: Look at the word parts too. Wind plus less: less means without, so windless means without wind. Other words work the same way, like hopeless (without hope) and careless (without care).
explain: Check the meaning by swapping it into the sentence: «The windless lake was smooth as glass.» Put "with no wind" in place of windless and the sentence still makes sense. Windless is often used with still and calm.
fact: Windless means without any wind.
fact: «A windless day» is calm, and the air is still.
fact: On a windless day, smoke rises straight up and flags hang down.
fact: «A windless night» can feel hot, still or spooky in a story.
fact: Windless is an adjective: it describes a noun such as day, night or sea.
exercise: «The windless morning was calm and quiet.» What does windless mean here? | With very strong wind | * With no wind at all | With lots of birds singing | With rain falling from the sky
exercise: On a windless day, what happens to a flag? | * It hangs down | It blows into the sea | It flies out straight in the wind | It spins around very fast
exercise: «The sea was still and windless.» Which word means the same as windless? | Stormy | Cold | * Calm | Noisy
test: «The sails hung limp on the windless sea.» Why could the boat not move? | Because the sails were too big | Because the sea was too deep | * Because there was no wind to push the sails | Because it was raining hard
test: What is a windless night like in a story? | Loud and noisy with thunder | Bright and sunny with a breeze | * Hot, still or spooky | Cold and wet with strong gusts
exam: «On the windless evening, the birds sat quietly in the trees.» What does windless mean? | A evening with a strong, blowing wind | * With no wind at all | With a lot of snow | With thick, grey clouds
